  "description": "WEGKUR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H96 Dy8 Ge12 N4 O64,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.741-3.771 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.74-110.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H100Dy8Ge12N4O66. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 24 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 16 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
